{"seq":1,"slug":"path-enumeration-dp","title":"路径枚举与动态规划搜索（RelOptInfo/add_path）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/plan-search-join/path-enumeration-dp","wordCount":2313,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"路径枚举与动态规划搜索-reloptinfo-add_path\">路径枚举与动态规划搜索（RelOptInfo/add_path）</h1><p>一条 12 表连接的报表 SQL 有约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>13</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.8 \\times 10^{13}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">13</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种可能的连接树，规划器不可能穷举。它实际做两件事：把每个中间结果集抽象成一条带代价的<strong>路径</strong>（<code>Path</code>），再用自底向上、逐层合并的搜索，在<strong>代价支配</strong>（dominance）下把无用路径剪掉。承载搜索的结构是 <code>RelOptInfo</code>（<code>src/include/nodes/pathnodes.h</code>），唯一剪枝入口是 <code>add_path()</code>（<code>src/backend/optimizer/util/pathnode.c</code>）。</p>\n<p>本节属于「计划搜索与连接优化」章节：上游输入是 <code>../2_statistics-cost-model/1_pg-statistic-mcv-histogram.md</code> 里的行数与选择率估计——搜索空间再大，若每个结点的 <code>rows</code> 估错，选出来的也是错的最优；下游是 <code>../4_executor-ops/INDEX.md</code>，路径最终被 <code>create_plan()</code> 编译成可执行的 Plan 树。规划入口与计划缓存见 <code>../1_parse-rewrite-plan-pipeline/3_planner-entry-plan-cache.md</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-reloptinfo-path-与代价支配\">核心概念：RelOptInfo、Path 与代价支配</h2><p><code>RelOptInfo</code> 是搜索的<strong>结点</strong>：一个基表、一个子查询结果、或若干表连接后的中间结果，都用同一个结构表示，区别只在 <code>relids</code>（包含哪些基表，一个 Bitmapset）以及被填充的字段。搜索的<strong>边</strong>就是 <code>pathlist</code>——同一个关系可能挂着几十条路径（顺序扫描、索引扫描、位图堆扫描、并行版本、各种连接顺序与参数化版本），它们都回答「这个关系会产生哪些行」，但代价与输出有序性不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RelOptInfo 字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>对搜索的作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>relids</code></td>\n<td>包含的基表集合（Bitmapset）</td>\n<td>连接合法性判据，也是「已访问集合」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rows</code> / <code>reltarget</code></td>\n<td>估算行数 / 需要输出的列</td>\n<td>代价输入；限定携带的列，影响宽度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pathlist</code> / <code>partial_pathlist</code></td>\n<td>候选路径 / 可汇总的部分路径</td>\n<td>路径竞争容器；并行赛道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cheapest_startup_path</code> / <code>cheapest_total_path</code></td>\n<td>首行最快 / 总代价最低</td>\n<td>上层取用的快捷入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cheapest_parameterized_paths</code></td>\n<td>每种参数化各保留最便宜的一条</td>\n<td>参数化赛道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>consider_startup</code> / <code>consider_parallel</code></td>\n<td>是否在意启动代价 / 允许并行</td>\n<td>由 LIMIT 比例与并行配置决定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两条路径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1, p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 回答同一个问题（同一 <code>relids</code>、同一参数化）时，若</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{startup}(p_1) \\le C_{startup}(p_2) \\;\\wedge\\; C_{total}(p_1) \\le C_{total}(p_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>则称 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <strong>支配</strong>（dominate）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，后者可从 <code>pathlist</code> 删除，因为它永远不会被选中。真实实现不用严格不等式，而引入模糊因子 <code>STD_FUZZ_FACTOR = 1.01</code>：代价相差不到 1% 就当作相同，此时不删路径，转而比较<strong>输出顺序</strong>（<code>pathkeys</code>）——这正是 <code>compare_path_costs_fuzzily()</code> 与 <code>compare_pathkeys()</code> 的分工。模糊因子避免因代价噪声剪掉一条上层可能需要的路径，代价是让搜索变成<strong>近似最优</strong>：PostgreSQL 的「动态规划」不是教科书里每个子集只留一条最优解的 DP，而是每个子集留一个<strong>路径集合</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"add_path-唯一的剪枝入口\">add_path：唯一的剪枝入口</h2><p><code>add_path(parent_rel, new_path)</code> 把新路径与 <code>parent_rel-&gt;pathlist</code> 中已有路径逐一比较，决定接受新路径（可能顺带删除被它支配的旧路径），或丢弃新路径（<code>pfree</code> 掉）。<code>add_paths_to_joinrel()</code> 对每一对 (outer, inner) 依次生成参数化 nestloop、merge、hash 路径，每生成一条就调用一次 <code>add_path</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代价比较结果</th>\n<th>再比较 pathkeys</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>明显不同（差距 &gt; 1%）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>两条都保留（回答不同权衡）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊相等</td>\n<td>新路径 pathkeys 严格更优</td>\n<td>删除旧路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊相等</td>\n<td>旧路径 pathkeys 严格更优</td>\n<td>丢弃新路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模糊相等</td>\n<td>pathkeys 相同</td>\n<td>保留其一（PG 17 起先看 <code>disabled_nodes</code> 少者）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>几个容易被忽略的判定：<strong>不同参数化的路径不互相竞争</strong>——若两条路径要求的 outer 关系集合（<code>param_info-&gt;ppi_req_outer</code>）不同，它们回答的是两个不同问题，<code>add_path</code> 跳过比较，两者共存，这正是 <code>cheapest_parameterized_paths</code> 存在的理由。<strong><code>consider_startup</code> 打开时启动代价也参与支配判定</strong>：查询带 <code>LIMIT</code>（<code>root-&gt;tuple_fraction &lt; 1.0</code>）时，总代价高但首行快的索引扫描不会被总代价更低的顺序扫描剪掉。<code>add_path_precheck()</code> 则在分配路径对象前先做廉价预判，用提前退出换吞吐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"join_search_one_level-逐层合并的三段式\">join_search_one_level：逐层合并的三段式</h2><p>基表层的路径由 <code>set_base_rel_pathlists()</code>（<code>src/backend/optimizer/path/allpaths.c</code>）填好，之后连接搜索逐层上升到所有关系被合并。主循环是 <code>standard_join_search()</code>（<code>src/backend/optimizer/plan/planner.c</code>）：把第 1 层设为基表，然后对每一层调用 <code>join_search_one_level()</code>（<code>src/backend/optimizer/path/joinrels.c</code>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;第 1 层:基表 RelOptInfo&lt;br/&gt;set_base_rel_pathlists&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;第 lev 层:join_search_one_level&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;阶段 1 make_rels_by_clause_joins&lt;br/&gt;有连接条件的旧关系两两配对&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;阶段 2 make_rels_by_clauseless_joins&lt;br/&gt;无连接条件的旧关系 → 交叉连接&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;本层已生成 join rel ?&quot;}&#10;    E -- 否 --&gt; F[&quot;阶段 3 bushy 兜底&lt;br/&gt;k 从 1 到 lev/2 遍历全组合&quot;]&#10;    E -- 是 --&gt; G[&quot;make_join_rel&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;join_is_legal / find_join_rel&lt;br/&gt;合法性校验 + 去重&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;add_paths_to_joinrel&lt;br/&gt;nestloop → merge → hash&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;add_path 逐条剪枝&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; K{&quot;lev &lt; levels_needed ?&quot;}&#10;    K -- 是 --&gt; B&#10;    K -- 否 --&gt; L[&quot;final_rel 取 cheapest_total_path&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"第 1 层:基表 RelOptInfo&lt;br/&gt;set_base_rel_pathlists\"] --&gt; B[\"第 lev 层:join_search_one_level\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"阶段 1 make_rels_by_clause_joins&lt;br/&gt;有连接条件的旧关系两两配对\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"阶段 2 make_rels_by_clauseless_joins&lt;br/&gt;无连接条件的旧关系 → 交叉连接\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"本层已生成 join rel ?\"}\n    E -- 否 --&gt; F[\"阶段 3 bushy 兜底&lt;br/&gt;k 从 1 到 lev/2 遍历全组合\"]\n    E -- 是 --&gt; G[\"make_join_rel\"]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[\"join_is_legal / find_join_rel&lt;br/&gt;合法性校验 + 去重\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"add_paths_to_joinrel&lt;br/&gt;nestloop → merge → hash\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"add_path 逐条剪枝\"]\n    J --&gt; K{\"lev &lt; levels_needed ?\"}\n    K -- 是 --&gt; B\n    K -- 否 --&gt; L[\"final_rel 取 cheapest_total_path\"]</pre><p>三段式的顺序不是随意的。<strong>阶段 1</strong> 只把「存在连接条件」的两个旧关系配对，这是绝大多数查询的实际搜索空间；<code>lev</code> 层的关系可来自第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层与第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>lev</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{lev}-k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lev</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>…</mo><mtext>lev</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 \\ldots \\text{lev}/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lev</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>，所以能生成<strong>左深树与浓密树（bushy）混合</strong>的形态。<strong>阶段 2</strong> 把无连接条件的关系（笛卡尔积）纳入搜索。<strong>阶段 3</strong> 兜底：若前两阶段本层一条路径都没生成（典型是全交叉连接），就穷举 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>lev</mtext><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{lev}-k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lev</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的全部组合。</p>\n<p>每对候选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(r_1, r_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 先过 <code>join_is_legal()</code>（<code>relids</code> 无交集、不违反半连接/反连接顺序约束与 <code>LATERAL</code> 引用），再由 <code>find_join_rel()</code> 在 <code>join_rel_hash</code> 里去重。真正生成路径的是 <code>populate_joinrel_with_paths()</code>：先试参数化 nestloop（内表用外表的值做索引查找），再试 merge join 与 hash join；能生成哪些路径还受 <code>enable_hashjoin</code>、<code>enable_mergejoin</code>、<code>enable_nestloop</code>、<code>enable_material</code>、<code>enable_memoize</code> 影响。每层结束由 <code>set_cheapest()</code> 标记 <code>cheapest_total_path</code>、<code>cheapest_startup_path</code> 并汇总 <code>cheapest_parameterized_paths</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"reloptinfo-rows-与-reltarget-搜索的两个约束面\">RelOptInfo.rows 与 reltarget：搜索的两个约束面</h2><p>每个新生成的 join rel 要立刻回答两个问题。<strong><code>rows</code> 由 <code>calc_joinrel_size_estimate()</code> 算出</strong>，输入是两侧 <code>rows</code> 与连接条件的选择率；<code>orders JOIN shipments ON o.id = s.order_id</code> 这类外键连接会被 <code>match_foreign_keys_to_quals()</code> 识别，按「外表行数 / 去重基数」而非独立假设相乘。行数高估偏 hash join，低估偏 nestloop。<strong><code>reltarget</code> 决定中间结果携带哪些列</strong>：40 列商品表只需 <code>id</code> 与 <code>price</code> 时，估算宽度与投影开销同步下降。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数化与并行-互不干扰的赛道\">参数化与并行：互不干扰的赛道</h2><p><code>pathlist</code> 之外还有两个平行结构。<strong>参数化路径</strong>用 <code>param_info</code> 声明「需要哪些 outer rel 提供值」，nestloop 内侧因此可以是参数化索引扫描——单次代价远低于全表扫描，但要多执行「外表行数」次；搜索必须同时保留不参数化的外侧最优与参数化的内侧候选，这正是 <code>add_path</code> 对不同 <code>param_info</code> 不比较的直接后果。<strong>部分路径</strong>是并行原料，仅当 <code>consider_parallel</code> 为真时生成，<code>add_partial_path()</code> 保留规则更严，最终由 <code>generate_gather_paths()</code> 用 <code>Gather</code>/<code>GatherMerge</code> 汇总后与串行最优比总代价；<code>Gather</code> 启动代价含等待 worker 开销，故小表上并行几乎从不被选中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"搜索空间爆炸与-geqo-切换\">搜索空间爆炸与 GEQO 切换</h2><p>连接顺序的数量增长极快：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个关系的<strong>左深树</strong>有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n!</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span></span></span></span></span> 种，允许 bushy 形态则达到</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(2n-2)!}{(n-1)!}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)!</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>13</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.8 \\times 10^{13}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">13</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 种。逐层 DP 虽远快于穷举，但关系数变大后仍失控：每层关系数组合数级增长。为此 PostgreSQL 设了若干门槛（官方配置文档 <code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/runtime-config-query.html</code>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>GUC</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>from_collapse_limit</code></td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>FROM 项超过此值，不再把子查询/子连接上拉扁平化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>join_collapse_limit</code></td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>显式 JOIN 的书写顺序超过此值后不再被打散重排</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>geqo_threshold</code></td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td>FROM 项达到此值，连接搜索切换到 GEQO 遗传算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>geqo</code></td>\n<td>on</td>\n<td>总开关；<code>SET geqo = off</code> 可强制走 DP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>geqo_effort</code></td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>规划时间 vs 计划质量的折中；<code>geqo_pool_size</code> / <code>geqo_generations</code> 为 0 时按它与关系数推算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>GEQO（<code>src/backend/optimizer/geqo/</code>，官方章节 <code>https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/geqo.html</code>）把连接顺序编码成染色体（关系的排列），用遗传算法迭代改进。每条染色体经 <code>gimme_tree()</code> 按排列顺序贪心构造连接树，再由 <code>add_paths_to_joinrel()</code> 评估代价作为适应度。它<strong>只搜索连接顺序</strong>，路径生成与代价模型与 DP 共用。要点有三：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>GEQO 不保证最优。</strong> 它用有限时间换一个「足够好」的计划，<code>geqo_pool_size</code> 与 <code>geqo_generations</code> 决定搜得多深。</li>\n<li><strong>GEQO 默认不保证可复现。</strong> 种子由 <code>geqo_seed</code> 控制，默认 0 表示每次规划用不同种子——同一 SQL 的同一参数可能在某次执行得到不同计划；测试要复现计划应显式固定它。</li>\n<li><strong>GEQO 只影响连接顺序</strong>，不影响是否并行、走不走索引。把「慢查询」归咎于 GEQO 之前，先用 <code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)</code> 确认瓶颈确实在连接形态。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>生产应对顺序：先把 12 表以上的报表 SQL 拆成 <code>WITH ... AS MATERIALIZED</code> 分段或落地临时表，把关系数压到阈值以下让 DP 接管；无法拆分时用 <code>SET LOCAL join_collapse_limit = 1</code> 让规划器<strong>照书写顺序</strong>连接（搜索空间降到 1，代价是要求人写好顺序），或用 <code>SET LOCAL geqo = off</code> 强制 DP 但接受规划时间上升；最不推荐只调高 <code>geqo_threshold</code>——那只是把爆炸点往后推。计划缓存层面还有联动：generic plan 在 GEQO 下更不可预测，倾斜参数场景应优先 <code>force_custom_plan</code>（见 <code>../1_parse-rewrite-plan-pipeline/3_planner-entry-plan-cache.md</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>搜索的数据结构是 <code>RelOptInfo</code>（结点）与 <code>Path</code>（边），唯一剪枝入口是 <code>add_path()</code>。</li>\n<li>支配规则用 1.01 的模糊因子；代价模糊相等时改比 <code>pathkeys</code> 与 <code>parallel_safe</code>，PG 17 起再加 <code>disabled_nodes</code>。因此 PostgreSQL 的 DP 是<strong>每个子集保留一个路径集合</strong>，结果是近似最优而非严格最优。</li>\n<li>不同参数化的路径互不竞争，各走 <code>cheapest_parameterized_paths</code> 一条赛道；部分路径走 <code>partial_pathlist</code>，最终靠 <code>Gather</code>/<code>GatherMerge</code> 进入比较。</li>\n<li>连接搜索是 <code>standard_join_search</code> → <code>join_search_one_level</code> 的逐层三段式（有连接条件 → 无连接条件 → bushy 兜底），每对关系经 <code>join_is_legal</code> 与 <code>find_join_rel</code> 去重后由 <code>populate_joinrel_with_paths</code> 生成 nestloop/merge/hash 路径。</li>\n<li><code>join_collapse_limit</code>（8）、<code>from_collapse_limit</code>（8）、<code>geqo_threshold</code>（12）共同决定搜索空间大小；超过阈值切换 GEQO，它只搜连接顺序、不保证最优、默认不保证可复现。</li>\n<li>排障入口固定为 <code>EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)</code> 的估算 vs 实际对照；<code>SET LOCAL join_collapse_limit = 1</code> 与 <code>SET LOCAL geqo = off</code> 是两个可快速验证的对照。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"路径枚举与动态规划搜索（RelOptInfo/add_path）","id":"路径枚举与动态规划搜索-reloptinfo-add_path"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：RelOptInfo、Path 与代价支配","id":"核心概念-reloptinfo-path-与代价支配"},{"level":2,"text":"add_path：唯一的剪枝入口","id":"add_path-唯一的剪枝入口"},{"level":2,"text":"join_search_one_level：逐层合并的三段式","id":"join_search_one_level-逐层合并的三段式"},{"level":2,"text":"RelOptInfo.rows 与 reltarget：搜索的两个约束面","id":"reloptinfo-rows-与-reltarget-搜索的两个约束面"},{"level":2,"text":"参数化与并行：互不干扰的赛道","id":"参数化与并行-互不干扰的赛道"},{"level":2,"text":"搜索空间爆炸与 GEQO 切换","id":"搜索空间爆炸与-geqo-切换"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"扩展统计、表达式统计与估算偏差诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/statistics-cost-model/extended-stats-estimation-bias"},"next":{"title":"连接算法选择与连接顺序优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/postgresql-query-planner-optimizer-internals/plan-search-join/join-order-algorithms"}}